+[role="xpack"]
+[testenv="enterprise"]
+[[searchable-snapshots-api-clear-cache]]
+=== Clear cache API
+++++
+<titleabbrev>Clear cache</titleabbrev>
+++++
+
+experimental::[]
+
+Clears indices and data streams from the <<shared-cache,shared searchable
+snapshot cache>>.
+
+[[searchable-snapshots-api-clear-cache-request]]
+==== {api-request-title}
+
